# Oozing Bag (holds the Disgusting Oozeling) from oozes across the world.
# Sources: items.json (droppers, 0.07-0.24% per kill, pfQuest); Forever client
# 1.60.1.70338.

step Oozing Bag
  tip Oozes drop the Oozing Bag: the Vile Slimes, Large Vile Slimes and Devouring Oozes of Western Plaguelands, and the oozes of Felwood, Un'Goro Crater and Eastern Plaguelands, at about 0.07-0.09% per kill in our data. The waypoint is a Vile Slime spawn in eastern Western Plaguelands.
  collect 20768 @64.9,38.7          -- Vile Slimes, Western Plaguelands

step Open the Oozing Bag
  tip Open the Oozing Bag from your bags.
  collect 20769 @64.9,38.7          -- Disgusting Oozeling
